B.pz=new A.pb("Settings & Storage",B.xK,7,"settings")
B.a3l=s(["Source Management: Toggle between 2024 Core Rules, 2014 SRD, and custom Homebrew sources to tailor your compendium views.","Battle Defaults: Configure default NPC/PC initiative modes (Roll Separated, Roll Grouped, or Enter Value) and default HP rules (Average vs Rolled).","Auto Roll Death Saves: Enable or disable automatic death saves for player characters or monsters when their turn starts at 0 HP.","Cloud vs Offline Mode: Core character sheets, local homebrew, and compendiums are stored locally and accessible without an internet connection.","Appearance & Themes: Toggle between Light and Dark themes optimized for high readability at the tabletop."],t.s)
B.aoI=new A.mu(B.pz,"Settings, Sources & Offline Capability",B.xK,"Customize Battle Defaults in Settings to choose whether NPCs roll initiative individually or in grouped initiative!",B.a3l,null)
